# Typography — Apple Music

Use the project font stack from `src/styles/fonts.css` (`--font-apple-music`) for all UI text.

- Global inheritance is set on `html` in `src/styles/index.css` — do not override with other font families in components.
- Prefer Tailwind `font-sans` when a utility class is needed; it maps to the same stack via `@theme`.
- Do not import Google Fonts or other third-party web fonts unless the user explicitly requests a change.
- Icon fonts (e.g. SVG-only or icon components) are exempt; only change text typography.
